    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-40" id="fn-40" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Details regarding long-term debt authorized:</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">The RIPUC approved the issuance of $1.2 billion aggregate principal amount of debt securities by Securities Certificate No. D-22-18, adopted June 8, 2023. As of December 31, 2025, $700 million of the $1.2 billion authorization remains unissued.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-41" id="fn-41" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">The amount reported of $88,229,250 represents the balance in Account 427. The difference between the reported amount and the sum of Account 427 and 430 is due to the $1,107,717 in Account 430, which is intercompany interest related to borrowing from CEP Reserves, Inc. for daily funding purposes.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
